WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.523
Wakkati ɗuɗɗi, ndiyam ɗon wara haa wakkati fuu.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:07.586
Ko'e maɓɓe ɓe mbi'i: "Ko'e mon, ko'e mooɗon mbi'imi".

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:11.802
Laru, bee noppi mawɗe e koyɗe mawɗe, ɗon ɗaɓɓa nyaamdu.

00:00:11.882 --> 00:00:15.712
Nde o nyaami nyaamdu, haa e oon sahaa o ɗon nyaama.
